{"id": 71, "name": "Kimmy", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_53a544034aaaf52b773be2d2450d16d4.png", "cls": ["Marksman", "Mage"], "specialty": ["Damage", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["30", "80", "50", "50"], "lanes": ["", ""], "story": "Born into a military family, she earned recognition through her own merit as the bold yet laid-back \"tough girl\" of the Border Guard.", "skills": [{"name": "Aerial Dominance", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_642/100_eeb909d230d71d199bbd3122a738b76b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Kimmy can move and aim in different directions while using her Spray Gun, but she cannot lock onto a specific target. Each <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chemical Bolt</span> deals <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+18% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+24% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Hitting enemy heroes or non-hero units restores 6 / 3 Starlium, respectively. At max Starlium, she continuously consumes it to enhance her Basic Attacks, making them deal <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+22.5% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+30% Total Magic Power)</span> damage and pierce targets (enhanced Basic Attacks only benefit from 50% Spell Vamp).\nKimmy can keep moving while shooting and does not benefit from Attack Speed Bonus. Every 1% Attack Speed gained is converted to 1 Magic Power.\nKimmy's Basic Attacks only deal 60% damage to Turrets."}, {"name": "Anti-Grav Thruster", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_90/100_493613c92ea4ee9483f41d659e8b5046.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 14", "desc": "Kimmy uses her jetpack to take flight, removing and becoming immune to slow effects. She can pass through terrain and gains 120% extra Movement Speed that decays over 1s. During the flight, she continuously fires 4 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chemical Bolts</span> at nearby enemies, each dealing 20<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+25% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slowing them by 50% for 0.5s.\nKimmy does not consume Starlium during flight."}, {"name": "Starlium Beam", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_642/100_a12d486bc0fe88134bc844174b505943.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Kimmy fires a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Starlium Beam</span> in the target direction, immobilizing enemies in its path and dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> for 1s.\nEach enemy hero hit grants 20 Starlium."}, {"name": "Traction Pulse", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_642/100_df6d2e3daa34ffeacc637e53f9765bb8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50", "desc": "Kimmy charges and fires a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Traction Pulse</span> in the target direction. Upon hitting an enemy or reaching its max range, it explodes to deal 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+54% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies and creates a force field that slows enemies within by 50%.\n\nAfter 1s, the field contracts, pulling all enemy heroes to its center and dealing 15% of their current HP as <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> while slowing them by 50% for 2s. Each enemy hero hit grants 40 Starlium."}], "builds": [{"lane": "MID", "winRate": 55.6, "pickRate": 4.77, "spell": {"name": "Purify", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d4fefd7da2cc6c1e6ddf41d788176e98.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Mage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c7febdebe70929be98c7007af3cd0f3a.png", "attrs": ["+30 Magic Power", "+5% Cooldown Reduction", "+8 Magic Penetration"]}, "items": [{"name": "Feather of Heaven", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e3c784601c1f2addd276194bf0b27ebe.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Concentrated Energy", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0bf7aa2a2ab3f03a2f8ac3b9f37dd2d1.png"}]}, {"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 53.7, "pickRate": 5.58, "spell": {"name": "Purify", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d4fefd7da2cc6c1e6ddf41d788176e98.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Mage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c7febdebe70929be98c7007af3cd0f3a.png", "attrs": ["+30 Magic Power", "+5% Cooldown Reduction", "+8 Magic Penetration"]}, "items": [{"name": "Feather of Heaven", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e3c784601c1f2addd276194bf0b27ebe.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Concentrated Energy", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0bf7aa2a2ab3f03a2f8ac3b9f37dd2d1.png"}]}, {"lane": "MID", "winRate": 52.5, "pickRate": 13.92, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/w